volunteer you but it's not rocket science no it's not we're happy to we're happy to it's it's very you it's very useful work like it is how we document what we are doing as a commission and bring people up to speed and make sure that the public knows what we're doing so it's it's a very useful endeavor i i can offer to take that on but i

